<!-- Directory.Version.props - Copyright (c) GDFrank
     SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
     ================================================================
     Central release-version file - RepoPub's own copy. NOT synced:
     dev.sync excludes props files (repo identity), so this copy is
     written explicitly by the same scripts that write RepoDev's -
     Set-ReleaseVersion.ps1 (`do config`, release: new M.m.p,
     Build=0) and Step-Build.ps1 (`do pub.refresh`, refresh:
     Build+1). The two copies are kept identical by those writes.
     See RepoDev's copy for the full explanation of the import
     chain and the Build field's meaning.

     RECREATED 2026-09-01: G manually deleted every file in RepoPub
     except .git*, for a clean re-test of the first real dev.sync -
     that included this file, which Set-ReleaseVersion.ps1 only
     ever UPDATES, never creates from scratch (its own "PHASE 1
     needs to have created it first" error is what flagged this).
     Values below are a placeholder skeleton - `do config` overwrites
     Major/Minor/Patch/Build the moment it runs.
     ================================================================ -->
<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Major>1</Major>
    <Minor>0</Minor>
    <Patch>0</Patch>
    <Build>5</Build>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>